        <body>
            <div xml:id="d423">

                <pb facs="0641" n="553" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg553"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hirsch to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-04-02"><hi rendition="#italic">April 2, 1892</hi></date>.
                        (Received April 16.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 420.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my No. 413 of March 26 and 416
                    of March 29, in the matter of Mr. Bartiett’s purchase of land in Smyrna, I now
                    have the honor to inclose copy of note verbale to the Sublime Porte on the
                    subject.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Solomon Hirsch.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d423-a1.xml" xpointer="d423-a1"/>
